Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.14,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}First guy into the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.14,0:00:02.72,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Olympic stadium.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.72,0:00:04.98,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}The crowd goes nuts!
