Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.00,0:00:09.49,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}broken down.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.65,0:00:11.73,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}St. Louis Olympics.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.73,0:00:13.17,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Fred {\c&H006DDCFF&}Lorz{\r} gets cramps
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.17,0:00:14.97,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}and catches a ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.97,0:00:16.65,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Picture running through dust,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.65,0:00:17.45,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}coughing up a fucking
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.45,0:00:18.51,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}lung, and some guy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.51,0:00:19.53,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}passes you without even
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.53,0:00:21.35,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}bending his knees.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.51,0:00:23.47,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Then the engine dies.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.47,0:00:24.93,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Holy shit, a medical
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.93,0:00:27.21,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}breakthrough! Too cramped to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.21,0:00:28.39,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}run, but the second
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.39,0:00:29.41,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}that bastard needs a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.41,0:00:31.93,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}push? Legs work fine,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.93,0:00:34.19,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}fellas! Fred jogs into
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.19,0:00:35.67,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}the stadium.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.67,0:00:37.81,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Everybody cheers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.81,0:00:38.73,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Somewhere in that crowd
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.73,0:00:39.37,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}is a guy who
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.37,0:00:40.61,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}just got overtaken by
